LCI-IEDB: licensing

1. Data (everything under data/processed, data/benchmark_splits, data/release, data/metadata)
   is derived from the Immune Epitope Database (IEDB), which is distributed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).
   The derived data are therefore released under CC BY 4.0:
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
   Required attribution: "Derived from the IEDB (https://www.iedb.org), export last updated 2026-11-01;
   Vita R, et al. The Immune Epitope Database (IEDB): 2024 update. Nucleic Acids Res. 2025."
   Please also cite the original studies via the PMIDs kept in the data.

2. Code (everything under src/ and tests/) is released under the MIT licence.

